# Per-app identifiers are passed in at call time (lanes take an `app:` option),
# so this file only holds what fastlane needs globally. The Play + App Store
# credentials come from env vars set by CI (see fastlane/README + Fastfile).

# App Store Connect API key (iOS uploads) - provided via env in CI:
#   ASC_KEY_ID, ASC_ISSUER_ID, ASC_KEY_CONTENT (base64 .p8)
# Google Play service account (Android uploads) - provided via env in CI:
#   SUPPLY_JSON_KEY_DATA (the service-account JSON)
